      "id": "https://www.archdaily.com/1185836/building-and-unbuilding-an-approach-to-circular-timber-construction-addressing-material-waste",
      "url": "https://www.archdaily.com/1185836/building-and-unbuilding-an-approach-to-circular-timber-construction-addressing-material-waste",
      "title": "[ArchDaily] Building and Unbuilding: An Approach to Circular Timber Construction Addressing Material Waste",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://images.adsttc.com/media/images/6ab6/d4d1/205c/9801/887f/5fe9/large_jpg/building-and-unbuilding-an-approach-to-circular-timber-construction-addressing-material-waste_19.jpg?1790367013\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75em;padding:5px 10px;background:#f0f4f8;border-left:3px solid #7b9fc4;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.82em;color:#444;line-height:1.8;\">🌾 <a href=\"https://zirnhelt.github.io/super-rss-feed/review.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.archdaily.com%2F1185836%2Fbuilding-and-unbuilding-an-approach-to-circular-timber-construction-addressing-material-waste\" style=\"color:#7b9fc4;text-decoration:none;\">✏️</a></p>\n<p>In the face of the <a href=\"https://www.archdaily.com/tag/climate-crisis\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">climate crisis</a> and within the framework of the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals, the reuse of materials has become prominent in the fields of construction and architecture in recent years. From \"urban mining\" to <a href=\"https://www.archdaily.com/1039767/how-to-measure-the-life-cycle-of-a-construction-material\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">life cycle assessments</a> (LCAs), professionals, organizations, and researchers are exploring different solutions and strategies to address the same overarching challenge. <a href=\"https://www.projectunbuild.org/?utm_medium=website&amp;utm_source=archdaily.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Project (Un)Build</a> is a research initiative developing reversible <a href=\"https://www.archdaily.com/tag/timber\">timber</a> construction methods that use straps and friction pads to facilitate <a href=\"https://www.archdaily.com/tag/material-reuse\">material reuse</a>. It contributes to the ongoing debate and reflection on the act of building itself.</p>",
      "date_published": "2026-10-07T04:00:00+00:00",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "ArchDaily",
          "url": "https://www.archdaily.com"
        }
      ],
      "image": "https://images.adsttc.com/media/images/6ab6/d4d1/205c/9801/887f/5fe9/large_jpg/building-and-unbuilding-an-approach-to-circular-timber-construction-addressing-material-waste_19.jpg?1790367013",
      "_score": 56,
      "_quality": 65,
      "_relevance": 72,
      "_local_score": 0,
      "_content_type": "analysis"
    },
